  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ensuring recovery from COVID-19 contributes to peace outcomes - Great Lakes</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="4">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">#N/A</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Dutch MFA, including the Embassy in Kigali, and wider institutional stakeholders</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to deepen our understanding of the evolving conflict dynamics in the COVID-19 context by looking at what political, economic and social factors underlying the conflict, who is mostly affected, how the Covid-19 pandemic has shaped or impacted relationships between actors (public and private), what are the trends in the near future and how broadly the conflict affect the cross border trade at different levels (from micro to macro).</narrative>
  </description>
